  "spectral": {
    "true_color": "Dark to medium green dominates the woodland and open vegetation. Upper-right and lower-right parcels are much brighter, mostly tan, beige or gray, with subtle striping. Small central and southern openings are lighter olive green. These color and brightness patterns are directly visible; confidence: high.",
